  "evidencia": "Page: Susan B. Landau. Sentence: Susan B. Landau (March 31, 1952 – May 31, 2017) was an American film producer, television producer, talent manager, and photographer whose credits included \"Mr. Destiny\" in 1990, \"Cool Runnings\" in 1993, \"An Ideal Husband\" in 1999, and the 2000 television film, \"Mary and Rhoda\".\nPage: Cool Runnings. Sentence: Cool Runnings is a 1993 American comedy sports film directed by Jon Turteltaub and starring Leon, Doug E. Doug, Rawle D. Lewis, Malik Yoba and John Candy.\nPage: Cool Runnings. Sentence: It was Candy's third to last film of his career and the last of his films to be released during his lifetime.",
