        "original_id": "78eda075-d50b-5271-8ec1-1967e7cc6641",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Susan B. Landau, Jon Turteltaub, Leon, Doug E. Doug, Rawle D. Lewis, Malik Yoba, John Candy\n- Products: Mr. Destiny, Cool Runnings, An Ideal Husband, Mary and Rhoda\n- Roles: film producer, television producer, talent manager, photographer, director, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Susan B. Landau was an American film producer, television producer, talent manager, and photographer who was born on March 31, 1952, and died on May 31, 2017.\n- Susan B. Landau's credits included the 1990 film \"Mr. Destiny.\"\n- Cool Runnings is a 1993 American comedy sports film directed by Jon Turteltaub and starring Leon, Doug E. Doug, Rawle D. Lewis, Malik Yoba, and John Candy.\n- Susan B. Landau's credits included the 1993 film \"Cool Runnings.\"\n- John Candy's film Cool Runnings was the third-to-last film of his career and the last of his films released during his lifetime.\n- Susan B. Landau's credits included the 1999 film \"An Ideal Husband.\"\n- Susan B. Landau's credits included the 2000 television film \"Mary and Rhoda.\"",
